  en: if you change your mind, saturday 5am. muara angke pier. i'll wait until 6

choice UNSENT by=sekar silent
  id: Balas Sekar?
  en: Reply to Sekar?
? Ketik "maaf" | Type "sorry"
  value sorry
? Ketik "gue dateng" | Type "i'll be there"
  value coming
? Tutup aplikasinya | Close the app
  value closed

system [if UNSENT == 'sorry']
  id: maaf_
  en: sorry_
system [if UNSENT == 'coming']
  id: gue dateng_
  en: i'll be there_
system [if UNSENT != 'closed']
